((date 2026-11-23) (slug nav-scale-participation)
 (hypothesis
  "USER 2026-11-22: liquidity rules should scale with CURRENT portfolio value, so account size changes which names fit. Pre-registered in #3699 (44f1ba28e, dev/experiments/nav-scale-participation-2026-11-23/README.md): the record spec at initial_cash 100k / 1M / 10M, each F (record floors: min_entry_dollar_adv 1M, min_hold_dollar_adv 500k) vs P (live-size profile: max_entry_adv_participation 0.10, entry dust floor 100k, hold floor 50k), K = 5 tie seeds. Decision arms P-100k (live question, #3693) and P-1M (#3681 verify item); P-10M and F across cash descriptive.")
 (base_scenario
  "record spec rk-k0..k4, 2000-01-01 -> 2026-06-26, top-3000 PIT v12 schedule, build 44f1ba28e, cloud sessions on R2 warehouse v12wk-9236 + corpact-2026-10-27; F-1M = the record (trades.csv md5 equals vsb-1 on every seed; TRIP_MD5 3ee10dca matched in all 5 sessions); V6 agree 15/15 pairs; every P arm LIVE 5/5; no sp500 cell.")
