 (verdict Inconclusive)
 (notes
  "Pre-registered rule applied as written. P-100k INCONCLUSIVE: median paired delta ln(P/F) +0.0020 (3 of 5 positive), median dDD +0.04 pp. P-1M INCONCLUSIVE: median -0.0243 (2 of 5 positive), median dDD -0.20 pp; valid and live, so it closes #3681's verify item as 'no effect at backtest NAV'. P-10M (descriptive) -0.62 to -0.98 on all 5 seeds (median -0.742), 362-395 round trips vs 533-558, doublers 2-3 vs 7-9 (ADMA 2023 at 54-88 % of ADV in F-10M): capacity between a 1M and a 10M start. F across cash (rounding null) moves the record up to 0.124 log. WHY: at 100k the cap removed no F trade (14 skips, 4 events, all names F never traded); the 100k floor admitted ~6 non-doubler names a seed (2003-07), and No_structural_stop takes back 238 of 249 sub-1M-ADV audit rows on k0. At 1M the cap blocks an ordinary slice (110 pooled F trades, median -5.9 %, 0 doublers); seed outcomes come from knock-on cash (ODSY block -> FOSL on k0; APPS 2020 cash draw on k1, +37 NAV%). FORWARD: keep max_entry_adv_participation default-off; live-size stays opt-in; no further cells on this axis without a new mechanism argument; #3693's small-NAV verify item stays open (P-100k positions start at ~14k, above live ~10k); capacity above a few M would need resize-to-cap (new sizing mechanism, W2) after #3136. Writeup: dev/experiments/nav-scale-participation-2026-11-23/READ.md (#3704)."))
